# Overlay Schema Rules

## File shape

- Root must be a GeoJSON `FeatureCollection`.
- One logical dataset per file under `overlays/<category>/`.
- Prefer Points in MVP; LineString/Polygon only when the feature is truly linear/areal.

## Required properties (each Feature)

```
id, name, category, kind, source, license
```

- `id`: unique repo-wide, kebab-case, prefer `category/slug`
- `category`: must match parent folder name
- `kind`: from the category allow-list in `docs/PLAN.md` / category README
- `source`: `survey` | `osm-gap` | `agent` | `import`
- `license`: default `ODbL-1.0` unless justified otherwise
- Optional: `verified_at` (ISO date), `website`, `opening_hours`, `extra` object

## Do / Don't

```json
// ✅ GOOD
{ "properties": { "id": "places/bucharest-cișmigiu-water", "category": "places", "kind": "drinking_water", "source": "survey", "license": "ODbL-1.0", "name": "…" } }

// ❌ BAD — missing id/category; private phone in properties
{ "properties": { "name": "My house", "phone": "+40…" } }
```

Validate against `schemas/overlay.schema.json` before finishing.
